The Star reports that the DeKalb County government fell victim to a cybersecurity incident for the second time in little more than a year. This time, it paid an invoice sent by threat actors impersonating a vendor: “On Thursday, October 1, 2026, DeKalb County Government became aware of a Financial Fraud Cyber Incident that had...
<p><a href="https://databreaches.net/2026/10/07/de-kalb-county-indiana-fell-prey-to-vendor-impersonation-billing/">Source</a></p>

